				"⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				155,
				7
			],
			"Message": "style(Sky): Remove unneeded @vite-ignore comments and simplify Wind dynamic imports\n\nThe @vite-ignore comments added in 6f05fb2a were a temporary workaround for Vite bundling dynamic imports from @codeeditorland/wind. After the Wind Target restructuring (84a4010c), these imports resolve cleanly without bundler interference.\n\nRemove @vite-ignore from dynamic imports across all Sky workbench entry points:\n- Electron/Bootstrap.ts (runBootstrap, InitializeWebSocket)\n- BrowserProxy/Bootstrap.ts (runBootstrap)\n- Bundled/Electron/Entry.ts (InstallLandWorkbench, InitializeWebSocket)\n- Electron/Extension/Change/Subscriber.ts (ChangeStream)\n- BrowserTest.astro and Mountain.astro (Install)\n\nReformat multiline await import() calls to single-line for consistency. Minor whitespace adjustments in astro.config.ts resolve callbacks.\n\nAll Wind imports now resolve directly from @codeeditorland/wind/Target/ without build-time suppression.",
			"SHA": "9765dfdd10aa6ea29edab2d02f7510c061aa4e2d"
		},
